{% set cycle = [period, 1] | max %}
{% set left = (cycle - age % cycle) % cycle %}
{% if left == 0 %}
the planets are aligned this age; slingshot orbits are open now (Age {{ age }}), then they open again in Age {{ age + cycle }}
{% else %}
slingshot orbits open in Age {{ age + left }} ({{ left | several("age", "ages") }} from now; the planets align every {{ cycle | several("age", "ages") }})
{% endif %}
